GET http://localhost:8080/api/delivery/available
Accept: application/json

###Alles loopt juist
@id1 = cccccccc-cccc-cccc-cccc-cccccccccccc
@courierId1 = 11111111-4444-4444-4444-111111111111

POST localhost:8080/api/delivery/{{id1}}/claim/{{courierId1}}
Accept: application/json

###Cancel order loopt juist
PUT localhost:8080/api/delivery/{{id1}}/claim/{{courierId1}}/cancel
Accept: application/json

###Cancel order loopt fout; niet zijn delivery
@courierId2 = 11111111-3333-3333-3333-111111111111

PUT localhost:8080/api/delivery/{{id1}}/claim/{{courierId2}}/cancel
Accept: application/json